    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPWARD: The story of a lizard longing for the Milky Way</h2>Challenge yourself with Action-Packed 2D Precision Platformer \u300aUPWARD\u300b.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410430/extras/7348404159a713d39ffd6ff80b0e6757.poster.avif?t=1619003229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410430/extras/7348404159a713d39ffd6ff80b0e6757.webm?t=1619003229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410430/extras/7348404159a713d39ffd6ff80b0e6757.mp4?t=1619003229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>A lizard who lived deep underground one day picked up a beautiful scarf.<br>Attracted by the light and color that does not exist in the ground, the lizard travels upward.<br>Can you help the lizard finish your journey to the Milky Way?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410430/extras/0a0dfae66dce550aa80a9ffbf87ca1ac.poster.avif?t=1619003229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410430/extras/0a0dfae66dce550aa80a9ffbf87ca1ac.webm?t=1619003229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
